Subject: [PATCH 10/33] Finder: group-by and actions capsules, scroll edge
 fade, own KXmlGui component

Finder used the 'dolphin' KXmlGui component, so it read and wrote stock
Dolphin's local toolbar layout. It is now 'finder'.

